{"word":"κύπτω","uri":"kuptô","senses":[{"word":"κύπτω","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">κύπτω</span></span> (<span class=\"ital\">f.</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">réc.</span> <span class=\"grec\">κύψω,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">ao.</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἔκυψα,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">pf.</span> <span class=\"grec\">κέκυφα</span>\n[<span class=\"grec\">ῡ</span>])\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> se baisser en avant,\n<span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 468,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">11, 585 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">κάτω,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Vesp.</span> <span class=\"refch\">279,</span> se pencher en\nbas ; <span class=\"grec\">ἐς τὴν γῆν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 14 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"refch\">fr. 349 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">εἰς γῆν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">586</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span>, se pencher à terre ; <span class=\"grec\">κέρεα\nκεκυφότα ἐς τὸ ἔμπροσθεν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">4, 183,</span> cornes penchées en avant,\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. de certains bœufs africains</span>\n||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> baisser la tête\n<span class=\"ital\">ou</span> les yeux par honte, par pudeur,\n<span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Eq.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1354,</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Th.</span> <span class=\"refch\">930 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. d’une personne pensive,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Epicrat.</span> (<span class=\"aut\">Ath.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">59</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>) ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> <span class=\"ital\">pour\nmarquer l’ardeur ou l’empressement :</span> <span class=\"grec\">κύψας ἐσθίει,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Pax</span> <span class=\"refch\">33,</span> il\nmange la tête sur son assiette, <span class=\"ital\">c. à d.</span>\navidement ; <span class=\"grec\">θέει κύψας,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ran.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1091,</span> il court tête baissée ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">4</span> être incliné vers la\nterre, <span class=\"ital\">en parl. des animaux,</span> <span class=\"ital\">p. opp. à l’homme,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">P.A.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2,\n11</span>.</div>\n<div class=\"etymrev\"><span class=\"etiqetymrev\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">pré-grec</span>.</div>\n"}]}